      "statement": "submitMove is the server-authoritative move gate: it rate-limits to 30/min, requires an in_progress match with a collecting round, rejects on server-side clock expiry, out-of-bounds, self-swap, frozen tiles, or duplicate submission, and inserts a move_submissions row while returning the swapped board only for optimistic UI.",
